  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejora de la Calidad del Gasto II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Expenditure Management Quality II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejorar la calidad de la gestin y del gasto pblico, a partir del fortalecimiento de las capacidades gubernamentales de anlisis y monitoreo vinculadas a temas normativos, presupuestales, de inversin pblica, y de gestin administrativa; as como la promocin de una mayor participacin del sector privado asociado al sector pblico en la inversin y en la provisin de servicios.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a PBL of US$200 millions that constitutes the second loan operation, of a total of three operations foreseen in the Programmatic of Quality Progress Management and Public Expenditure approved in 2005 (1699OC-PE). To establish the conditions of payment of 2006, the triggers defined in the loan of 2005 (1699OC-PE) will be checked.</narrative>
  </description>
